[version]
1.2.2
[date]
2026-10-21
[whatsnew]
- Fixed BIOS crash when disk drive is attached (use peripheral.wrap + pcall)
- Update installer now checks disk space before downloading
- Updater cleans up /tmp/update.pending on failure (no more boot loop)
- Old backups are auto-removed (keep only the most recent)
- 'update install' shows disk space estimate before proceeding
[/whatsnew]
